1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:08,320
When unpolarized light strikes glass or water, both the reflected and the refracted beams come out partly polarized.

2
00:00:08,320 --> 00:00:10,065
Watch the reflected beam.

3
00:00:10,065 --> 00:00:16,484
Its arrow component, vibrating in the plane of incidence, shrinks as we change the angle.

